.TH "Pamstretch-gen User Manual" 0 "15 January 2019" "netpbm documentation"

.SH "نام (NAME)"

pamstretch-gen \- use pamstretch and pamscale to scale by non-integer values

.UN synopsis
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"

\fBpamstretch-gen\fP \fIN\fP [\fIpnmfile\fP]

.UN description
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This program is part of
.BR "Netpbm" (1)\c
\&.
.PP
\fBpamstretch-gen\fP is a program which uses
.BR "pamstretch" (1)\c
\& and
.BR "pamscale" (1)\c
\& to scale up a Netpbm image
smoothly by any factor; it's like a more general version of \fBpamstretch\fP
(hence the name).

\fBpamstretch-gen\fP uses the \fB-dropedge\fP option on \fBpamstretch\fP.


.UN options
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
There are no command line options defined specifically for
\fBpamstretch-gen\fP, but it recognizes the options common to all programs
based on libnetpbm (See 
.UR index.html#commonoptions
 Common Options
.UE
\&.)
.PP
The Netpbm global options \fB-quiet\fP and \fB-plain\fP did not
exist on \fBpamstretch-gen\fP prior to version 10.86 (March 2019).
\fB-quiet\fP did not work until version 10.91 (June 2020).


.UN seealso
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR "pamstretch" (1)\c
\&,
.BR "pamscale" (1)\c
\&

.UN author
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"

Russell Marks (\fIrussell.marks@ntlworld.com\fP).
